  "prefLabel": "Fis 1502.12 Replacement of Missing or Destroyed Registration Certificate",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fis 1502.12 Replacement of Missing or Destroyed Registration Certificate. An applicant seeking replacement of a missing or destroyed registration certificate shall complete and submit the form entitled, “Request for Duplicate of Current Season or Antique Registration Certificate”, as revised 3/2020 at department headquarters, in person, or by mail.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Fis 1500) #12590, eff 7-25-18; ss by #13199, eff 4-30-21",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/fis1500.html"
